hour\" row with alarm/location icon (brand).\n- Product Details: title 16 SemiBold + body 12 #8F959E (the long Chicago colorway text, ~4 lines) + \"More\" brand 12 SemiBold.\n- Policies row: 3 items with icons: Nearest Store (location), VIP (VIP icon), Return policy (return icon) — 12 labels. \n- Similar To: header \"Similar To\" + \"282+ Items\" 12 + Sort/Filter chips; 4 cards row (like deal cards) with data (Nike Sneakers names + prices + rating counts).\n- Actions: row with 2 outlined buttons: \"View Similar\" + \"Add to Compare\" (icon+text chips); bottom bar: \"Go to cart\" outlined? Kit: bottom bar with \"Go to Cart\" (white, brand text, border) + \"Buy Now\" (primary). \n- Main nav (Home active) at bottom.\n\n**12_Shopping_Bag** (~812+ maybe 900):\n- Header: back (→11) + \"Shopping Bag\" 18 SemiBold centered? + wishlist icon right (entry).\n- Item card: photo 80×80 (Bag_Womens_Casual_Wear), name \"Women's Casual Wear\" 14 SemiBold, \"Size 42\" with chevron-down chip, \"Qty 1\" with chevron-down chip, \"Delivery by 10 May\" 11 with calendar icon, price ₹7,000.00 14 SemiBold.\n- Apply Coupons row: coupon icon + \"Apply Coupons\" + \"Select\" brand 12.\n- Order Payment Details card: title 14 SemiBold; rows: \"Order Amounts\" ₹7,000.00; \"Convenience Fee\" ? — brief: \"Convenience: Know More\" → row \"Convenience Fee\" + \"Know More\" brand + maybe ₹0? Brief doesn't give amount; I'll show \"Convenience Fee — Know More\" (₹0? safer without amount: value \"Know More\" only). \"Apply Coupon\" row with value \"Apply Coupon\"? hmm brief: \"Apply Coupons \"Select\" · ... Order Payment Details: Order Amounts ₹7,000.00 · Convenience: Know More · Apply Coupon · Delivery Fee ₹30.00 · Order Total ₹7,030.00 · EMI Available · Details\". So details list: Order Amounts ₹7,000.00 / Convenience Fee + Know More link / Apply Coupon row (link) / Delivery Fee ₹30.00 / divider / Order Total ₹7,030.00 / \"EMI Available\" + \"Details\" link.\n- View Details link? \"View Details\" action