uttons: Change Password (outlined) + Save (primary).\n\nPrototype wiring: as listed. Main nav tabs on 09/10/11/13: Home tab → 09, Cart tab → 12, Setting tab → 15, Wishlist/Search no link.\n\nApproach for components as reusable: I'll create master components in Workspace under a \"Components\" section at x=500.. and place instances in frames. Components list (my own):\n1. `App/Header Bar` (menu, logo, avatar) — used 09, 10.\n2. `App/Main Nav` — variants Active=Home / Active=Cart. Build two components and combineAsVariants.\n3. `App/Search Bar` — used 09, 10.\n4. `Home/Section Header` — flexible? Text overrides per instance. I'll make component with title + right slot text; override text content per use.\n5. `Cards/Product Card` — used in trending (5) & list (14) — sizes differ (120 vs 163 wide). I'll make one component 160 wide and resize instances? Auto layout would help. I'll build with auto layout so instances resize. Use auto layout throughout cards.\n6. `Cards/Deal Card` — 4 on home, 4 similar on detail (similar cards have no discount data — name/price/ratings only). Deal card has price+was+off; similar card name+price+rating count. I'll make `Cards/Mini Card` with image, name, price row (price, was, off) and rating row — hide/show elements per instance via visibility overrides. \n7. `Inputs/Password Field` — field + eye.\n8. `Buttons/Social Button` — circular w/ icon instance.\n9. `Buttons/Chip` — for Sort/Filter and sizes: text chip with optional icon. Two variants? Just override text; selected state via instance fills override.\n10. `Payment/Method Row` — radio + logo + name + number; selected border via override.\n11. `Profile/Field Row` — label + value.\n12. `Onboarding/Progress` — 3 bars + caption.\n\nThat's a good component system. Plus using given Button + Text Field + Status Bar + Home Indicator instances everywhere.\n\nOne concern: overriding text inside nested component instances requires loading fonts for those text nodes (Montserrat). Fine.\n\nImage