{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/tB1sUry3dJDspx8uxl0ftc/ (fileKey `tB1sUry3dJDspx8uxl0ftc`). Requirements:\n   - Confirm assigned account via whoami: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (confirmed ✓)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" for the product/brief, \"01 · Foundations\" for visual rules, reuse \"02 · Components\" components, use \"04 · Media\" assets, deliver complete design into \"03 · Workspace\"\n   - Build the complete \"Stylish\" fashion & lifestyle mobile shopping app: exactly 15 frames named exactly as specified, wired as a clickable prototype with listed links\n   - Canvas 375×812, light mode only, Indian rupee (₹), Indian digit grouping (1,52,344)\n   - Preserve all reference pages and their nodes; do not create a different file or switch accounts\n   - Before EVERY tool call include a visible decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response must start \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\" with file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations\n   - Unattended session: resolve routine choices from the brief without waiting\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (50k char limit per call; helpers must be re-declared in EVERY call since scope doesn't persist; failed calls ROLL BACK all changes from that call)\n   - figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page) required (not currentPage setter); figma.loadFontAsync before text ops\n   - All media assets are COMPONENTS: photo tiles have IMAGE fills, icons/logos have