{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/tB1sUry3dJDspx8uxl0ftc/ (fileKey `tB1sUry3dJDspx8uxl0ftc`). Requirements:\n   - Confirm assigned account via whoami: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (CONFIRMED earlier — Full seat on \"Sensenova design\" enterprise plan)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" for the product/brief, \"01 · Foundations\" for visual rules, reuse \"02 · Components\" components, use \"04 · Media\" assets, deliver the complete design into \"03 · Workspace\" (page 5:2)\n   - Build the complete \"Stylish\" fashion & lifestyle mobile shopping app: exactly 15 frames named exactly as specified, wired as a clickable prototype with the listed links\n   - Canvas 375×812, light mode only, Indian rupee (₹), Indian digit grouping (1,52,344), \"was\" price struck through\n   - Preserve all reference pages and their nodes; do not create a different file or switch accounts\n   - Before EVERY tool call include a visible decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response must start \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\" with file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations\n   - Unattended session: resolve routine choices from the brief without waiting for a human\n   - Brief wins over any knowledge of the original kit. Evaluation: checklist coverage, data & copy accuracy, flow/prototype completeness, information hierarchy, visual quality/consistency, component reuse, state design (current tab/size/slide/step/payment method, empty forms)\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (50k char limit; helpers must be re-declared in EVERY call — scope doesn't persist; a FAILED call ROLLS BACK all changes from that call)\n   - MUST `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` at the start of every call (default current page is otherwise not 5:2, breaking combineAsVariants and node placement)\n   - figma.loadFontAsync for Montserrat Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold before any text ops\n   - All 04 · Media assets are COMPONENTS: photo tiles have IMAGE fills, icons have VECTOR children — reuse via createInstance(); resize (FILL-scale crops); recolor via tint() override; swap nested instances via `inner.swapComponent(targetComponent)`\n   - CANNOT appendChild inside a component instance (\"Cannot move node. New parent is an instance...\") — overlays like no-photo icons go on the parent regular frame instead\n   - Variant creation: build frame → figma.createComponentFromNode → set name \"Prop=Value\" → figma.combineAsVariants([a,b], page)\n   - Text overrides on instances: findAll(n=>n.type===\"TEXT\"), set characters/fontSize in document order\n   - `await` inside a helper requires the helper declared `async` (SyntaxError otherwise)\n   - Prototype wiring (pending): `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}, action:{type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\"}}]`; splash auto-advance `{trigger:{type:\"AFTER_DELAY\", timeout:2000}}`\n   - sessionId parameter not required by these tools; skillNames omitted\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file tB1sUry3dJDspx8uxl0ftc. Pages: 0:1 (00 · Start Here), 1:2 (01 · Foundations), 1:3 (02 · Components), 1:4 (04 · Media), 5:2 (03 · Workspace — delivery target)\n   - **Media component ID map**: Onboarding: 3:59 Choose_Products, 3:62 Make_Payment, 3:65 Get_Your_Order, 3:68 Get_Started_Photo(144×180), 3:71 Avatar_Illustrated. Categories: 3:77 Beauty, 3:80 Fashion, 3:83 Kids, 3:86 Mens, 3:89 Womens, 3:92 Gifts. Promos: 3:98 Banner_Sale(300×120), 3: