l Colours)\" · 56,890 ratings · ₹1,500 · was ₹2,999 · 50% Off; Product Details text: \"Perhaps the most iconic sneaker of all-time, this original \"Chicago\" colorway is the cornerstone to any sneaker collection. Made famous in 1985 by Michael Jordan, the shoe has stood the test of time, becoming the most famous colorway of the Air Jordan 1. This 2015 release saw the…\" + More; Sizes 6 UK/7 UK(selected, \"Size: 7 UK\")/8 UK/9 UK/10 UK; \"Delivery within 1 hour\"\n     - Similar To (282+ Items), each labeled Nike Sneakers: \"Nike Air Jordan Retro 1 Low Mystic Black · ₹1,900 · 46,890\" (3:197); \"Mid Peach Mocha Shoes For Man White Black Pink Sneakers · ₹1,900 · 2,56,890\" (3:200); \"Nike Air Jordan 1 Low Shoes For Man Basketball Shoes · ₹1,900 · 1,56,890\" (3:203); \"Jordan 1 Hyper Royal Heavy Quality · ₹1,500 · 96,890\" (3:206)\n     - Bag & payment: Item \"Women's Casual Wear\" (3:212) · Size 42 · Qty 1 · \"Delivery by 10 May\" · ₹7,000.00; Order Amounts ₹7,000.00 + Delivery Fee ₹30.00 = Order Total ₹7,030.00; payment summary Order ₹7,000 · Shipping ₹30 · Total ₹7,030; methods VISA(3:215)/PayPal(3:218)/Maestro(3:221)/Apple Pay(4:17) each \"*********2109\", VISA selected\n     - Profile: Email Address aashifa@gmail.com · Password masked; Business Address: Postcode N1 2LL · Address 216 St Paul's Rd · City London · State England · Country United Kingdom; Bank: Account Number 204356XXXXXXX · Account Holder's Name Abhiraj Sisodiya · IFSC Code SBIN00428\n     - User: Aashifa · aashifa@gmail.com · avatar = Avatar_Illustrated (3:71)\n   - **Navigation structure (verbatim)**: Onboarding 01→02→03→04→05; Skip on 02–04 → 05. 05↔06; 05→07→05. Login/Create Account→08→09. Main nav on 09/10/11/13 — five tabs: Home(Icon_Home)→09 · Wishlist(entry only) · Cart(Icon_Cart)→12 · Search(entry only) · Setting(Icon_Settings)→15; current tab must match frame. Purchase: 09→11→12→13→14 (dialog over 13)→09. Links: 09 Trending View all→10, Sponsored→11, tabs; 11 back→09, Go to cart→12, tabs; 12