13:113 (x=1525); 05_Sign_In 14:108 (x=2000); 06_Sign_Up 14:151 (x=2475); 07_Forgot_Password 14:200 (x=2950); 08_Get_Started 14:222 (x=3425); 09_Home 17:345 (375×1780, x=100,y=200); 10_Product_List 18:345 (375×1990, x=575,y=2100); 11_Product_Detail 19:527 (375×1680, x=1050,y=2100); 12_Shopping_Bag 20:619 (375×812, x=1525,y=2100); 13_Payment 21:637 (375×812, x=2000,y=2100); 14_Payment_Success_Overlay 21:707 (clone of 13, x=2475,y=2100, dim 45% + Success Dialog 300×180 at (37.5,316) w/ green #2AA952 circle 64 + white SVG check + \"Payment done successfully.\"); 15_Profile 21:731 (375×1150, x=2950,y=2100)\n   - **09_Home layout (17:345)**: sb y0, header (20,52), search (20,108), Banner 335×140 (20,172) [3:110 + 30% black overlay + \"40–50% OFF\" 22 Bold + \"Now in all products\" + \"All colours\" + Shop Now pill + 3 dots slide2 active]; 6 categories 55×55 y=332 + labels y=394; \"Deal of the Day\"+\"View all\" y=428, \"22h 55m 20s remaining\" y=456, Deal Row clip 335×205 (20,478) w/ 4 mini cards; \"All Featured\" y=700, Sort/Filter chips y=730; \"Special Offers 😱\" y=778 + subtitle \"We make sure you get the offer you need at best prices\" y=806; p1 3:101 (20,830) + p2 3:104 (193,830) + Flat and Heels overlay (14 SemiBold white y=908, \"Stand a chance to get rewarded\" 9 y=928) + Visit now pill 66×20 (209,920); p3 3:107 (20,968); \"New Arrivals\"+\"View all\" y=1104; p4 3:98 (20,1134) + \"Summer' 25 Collections\" (36,1222); \"Sponsored\"+\"up to 50% Off\" y=1270; p5 3:182 (20,1300); \"Trending Products\"+\"View all\" y=1436, \"Last Date 28/02/22\" y=1464, Trending Row clip 335×200 (20,1486); nav Active=Home y=1696\n   - **Verbatim fixed data (required word-for-word)**: Deal: Women Printed Kurta ₹1,500/₹2,499/40% Off/56,890; HRX by Hrithik Roshan ₹2,499/₹4,999/50% Off/3,44,567; Philips BHH880/10 + \"Hair Straightening Brush With Keratin Infused Bristles (Black).\" ₹999/₹1,999/50% Off/6,46,776; TITAN Men Watch- 1806N + \"This Titan watch in Black color is I wanted to buy f