ishlist, 4:49 Search, 4:150 Location, 4:155 VIP, 4:160 Return) and RE-CREATE them fresh without tint (fresh instance keeps component default styling which rendered fine in 07/09). Also check 15.\n\nSimplest robust: for each frame in [11,12,13,14,15]: for each instance whose component master is one of the icon set AND that currently has a solid fill override (check node.fills of instance or descendants) — just delete and recreate at same x/y/size without tint. Fresh instances of 4:60 etc. default color = component's own (likely #1A1D1E dark) ✓.\n\nBut careful: nav bar icons (in Main Navigation instances) — those are inside the nav component instances, not to touch (they render fine).\n\nWhich to replace: on 11: back top-left, search top-right, 3 icons in perks row (Location 4:150, VIP 4:155, Return 4:160). On 12: back (4:60), heart (4:36). On 13 (+14 clone): back (4:60). On 15: check screenshot next.\n\nHow to identify: search frames for INSTANCE nodes whose mainComponent is one of icons AND (self or descendants have fills override). Easier: list all instances per frame with master id + name + x,y,w,h; filter by icon master ids; recreate all of them regardless of tint (fresh look = component default which is correct).\n\nWait — do I know the icon defaults are dark? 07 back chevron = black ✓; 09 menu = dark ✓; heart in nav = gray outline (that's inside nav comp with its own styling). Fresh heart instance (4:36) default: probably #1A1D1E fill/stroke — fine for top bar.\n\nAlso 11's perks icons (Location/VIP/Return): fresh default color dark — acceptable (kit shows dark glyphs).\n\nAlso, don't recreate icons that are fine (e.g., 11's star 4:86 in rating row — renders ✓ small black star... fine, leave).\n\nPlan fix call:\n```\nconst iconIds=new Set([\"4:60\",\"4:36\",\"4:49\",\"4:150\",\"4:155\",\"4:160\",\"4:65\",\"4:70\",\"4:75\",\"4:81\",\"4:96\",\"4:111\",\"4:116\",\"4:132\",\"4:138\"]);\nfor fid of [\"19:527\",\"20:619\",\"21:637\",\"21:707\",\"21:731\"]:\n  f=M(fid