{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/tB1sUry3dJDspx8uxl0ftc/ (fileKey `tB1sUry3dJDspx8uxl0ftc`). Requirements:\n   - Account confirmed via whoami: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (DONE — Full seat, \"Sensenova design\" plan)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" for product/brief, \"01 · Foundations\" for visual rules, reuse \"02 · Components\" components, use \"04 · Media\" assets, deliver complete design into \"03 · Workspace\" (page 5:2)\n   - Build the complete \"Stylish\" fashion & lifestyle mobile shopping app: exactly 15 frames named exactly 01_Splash … 15_Profile, wired as a clickable prototype\n   - Canvas 375×812, light mode only, Indian rupee (₹), Indian digit grouping (1,52,344), \"was\" price struck through\n   - Preserve all reference pages/nodes; do not create a different file or switch accounts/teams\n   - Before EVERY tool call include a visible decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response must start \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\" with file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations\n   - Unattended session: resolve routine choices from the brief without waiting for a human; report actual limitations if blocked\n   - \"This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" \"Do not add frames beyond the 15.\"\n   - Evaluation: checklist coverage, data & copy accuracy (verbatim fixed data), flow/prototype completeness, information hierarchy, visual quality/consistency, component reuse, state design (current tab/size/slide/step/payment method, empty forms)\n   - Inspect screenshots of all 15 required screens; fix visible problems and re-verify; a successful screenshot alone is not completion\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (50k char limit; helpers must be re-declared in EVERY call; a FAILED call ROLLS BACK all changes from that call)\n   - MUST `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` at start of every call; `figma.loadFontAsync` for Montserrat Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold before text ops\n   - **Nested instance override rule (validated this segment)**: position (x/y → relative-transform) and size (resize) CANNOT be set on nodes NESTED inside an instance — throws \"This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform\". Only text overrides (characters, fontSize, fills, textDecoration, textAutoResize) work on nested nodes. Top-level instances in a frame CAN be positioned/resized.\n   - **Stale text height reads**: reading `text.height` immediately after setting characters + textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\" can return the pre-reflow height → manual absolute-position layouts overlap. Fix: use auto-layout frames for stacking (no manual y math).\n   - **Auto-layout mini-card pattern (working)**: card.layoutMode=\"VERTICAL\", primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\" (height hugs), counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\" (width fixed), itemSpacing=4; children with layoutSizingHorizontal=\"FILL\" + textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\" for wrapping text; price row: layoutMode=\"HORIZONTAL\", layoutWrap=\"WRAP\", primaryAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\", counterAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\", counterAxisSpacing=2\n   - **Correct reactions schema (validated previously, all wiring done)**: `node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"},actions:[{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:\"id\",navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\",duration:0.2,easing:{type:\"EASE_IN_AND_OUT\"}}}]}]`; auto-advance: `{trigger:{type:\"AFTER_TIMEOUT\",timeout:2000},actions:[...]}` — uses `actions` (array) NOT `action`, `timeout` NOT `delay`, `AFTER_TIMEOUT` NOT `AFTER_DELAY`, transition REQUIRED on NODE actions\n   - Media assets are COMPONENTS reused via createInstance(); photo swap via `inner.swapComponent(comp)`; no-photo fallback: gray #F0F0F0 rounded frame + gray search icon instance appended at card level\n   - `get_screenshot` with `enableBase64Response:true` returns inline viewable images (needed for visual verification); URL-only responses require curl\n   - mainComponent.id identifies instances (2:24=Button, 4:60=Back, 12:67/12:70=small buttons)\n   - rescale() scales node + children proportionally incl. font sizes (used in failed approach; replaced by auto-layout approach)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file tB1sUry3dJDspx8uxl0ftc. Pages: 0:1 (00 · Start Here), 1:2 (01 · Foundations), 1:3 (02 · Components), 1:4 (04 · Media), 5:2 (03 · Workspace — delivery target)\n   - **Media component IDs**: Onboarding ill 3:59/3:62/3:65, Get_Started_Photo 3:68, Avatar 3:71; Categories 3:77,3:80,3:83,3:86,3:89,3:92; Promos 3:98,3:101,3:104,3:107,3:110; Deals 3:116,3:119,3:122; Trending 3:125,3:128,3:131,3:134; List 3:140→3:176 (14, in order, D7200 has none); Nike_Sneakers_1–5: 3:182,3:185,3:188,3:191,3:194; Similar_1–4: 3:197,3:200,3:203,3:206; Bag 3:212; Logos VISA 3:215/PayPal 3:218/Maestro 3:221/Google 3:224/Apple 4:17; Stylish_Logo 4:11; Icons: Home 4:31, Wishlist 4:36, Cart 4:43, Search 4:49, Settings 4:55, Back 4:60, Menu 4:65, Voice 4:70, Sort 4:75, Filter 4:81, Star 4:86, Alarm 4:96, Chevron_Right 4:111, Chevron_Down 4:116, Lock 4:132, Eye 4:138, Location 4:150, VIP 4:155, Return 4:160; Shell: 2:34 Status Bar, 2:45 Home Indicator, 2:24 Button (317×55 #F83758 \"Login\"), 2:29 Text Field\n   - **Workspace components**: Header Bar 8:52; Search Bar 8:61; Section Header 8:65 (**375 wide**, Title text x=20 y=2 fs18, \"View all\" text x=288 y=8 fs12); Chip 8:70; Product Card 10:22 (163w); Mini Card 10:34 (VERTICAL auto-layout 105×300: img INSTANCE 105×105 @(0,0), \"Product Name\" TEXT 105×16 fs12 @(0,110), \"Price\" FRAME HORIZONTAL WRAP hugH 127×16 @(0,131), \"Rating\" FRAME 47×12 @(0,152)); Main Navigation set 10:81 (Active=Home/Active=Cart); Social Button 10:86; Password Field 12:42 (317×55 = Text Field instance 12:37 + Icon_Eye 12:39); Payment Method Row set 12:56; Profile Field Row 12:61; Button Outline 12:64; Button Primary Small 12:67; Button Outline Small 12:70\n   - **Built frames (ALL 15 EXIST)**: 01_Splash 13:39 (x=100,y=0); 02_Onboarding_Choose_Products 13:59 (x=575); 03_Onboarding_Make_Payment 13:85 (x=1050); 04_Onboarding_Get_Your_Order 13:113 (x=1525); 05_Sign_In 14:108 (x=2000); 06_Sign_Up 14:151 (x=2475); 07_Forgot_Password 14:200 (x=2950); 08_Get_Started 14:222 (x=3425); 09_Home 17:345 (375×1780, x=100,y=200); 10_Product_List 18:345 (375×1990, x=575,y=2100); 11_Product_Detail 19:527 (375×1680, x=1050,y=2100); 12_Shopping_Bag 20:619 (375×812, x=1525,y=2100); 13_Payment 21:637 (375×812, x=2000,y=2100); 14_Payment_Success_Overlay 21:707 (clone of 13, x=2475,y=2100, dim 45% + Success Dialog 300×180 at (37.5,316) w/ green #2AA952 circle + white check + \"Payment done successfully.\"); 15_Profile 21:731 (375×1150, x=2950,y=2100)\n   - **09_Home current state (17:345)**: sb y0, header (20,52), search (20,108), Banner 335×140 (20,172) [3:110 + overlay + \"40–50% OFF\" + \"Now in all products\" + \"All colours\" + Shop Now pill + dots slide2 active]; 6 categories 55×55 now at x=20+i*59 y=332 + labels centered y=394 (all incl. \"Gifts\" visible); \"Deal of the Day\"/\"View all\" y=428, timer y=456, **Deal Row** frame 335×205 (20,478) with 4 auto-layout minis (w=80, x=i*85): Women Printed Kurta (3:116), HRX (3:119), Philips (gray #F0F0F0 photo + desc), TITAN (3:122); \"All Featured\" y=700, Sort/Filter chips y=730; \"Special Offers 😱\" y=778 + subtitle y=806; promos p1 3:101 (20,830) + p2 3:104 (193,830) + \"Flat and Heels\" text now y=884 + \"Stand a chance to get rewarded\" y=904 + Visit now pill (209,920); p3 3:107 (20,968); \"New Arrivals\" y=1104; p4 3:98 (20,1134) + \"Summer' 25 Collections\"; \"Sponsored\" header REPLACED with direct texts (18 SemiBold + \"up to 50% Off\" 12 Medium right-aligned to 355) — fully visible; p5 3:182 (20,1300); \"Trending Products\" y=1436, \"Last Date 28/02/22\" y=1464, **Trending Row** 335×190 (20,1486) with 5 minis (w=64, x=i*67); nav Active=Home y=1696\n   - **Working buildMini (auto-layout version)**:\n```js\nconst starC=await M(\"4:86\");\nfunction buildMini(row,d,x,s){\n  const w=Math.round(105*s);\n  const card=FR(\"Mini · \"+d.short,w,10,null,false);\n  card.layoutMode=\"VERTICAL\"; card.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; card.counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\"; card.itemSpacing=4;\n  card.resize(w,10);\n  let ph;\n  if(d.photo){ ph=d.photo.createInstance(); } else { ph=FR(\"Photo\",w,w,\"#F0F0F0\",false); ph.cornerRadius=10; }\n  card.appendChild(ph); ph.layoutSizingHorizontal=\"FIXED\"; ph.layoutSizingVertical=\"FIXED\"; ph.resize(w,w);\n  const nm=T(d.name,12*s,\"Medium\",\"#1A1D1E\"); nm.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\"; card.appendChild(nm); nm.layoutSizingHorizontal=\"FILL\";\n  if(d.desc){ const de=T(d.desc,8.5*s,\"Regular\",\"#8F959E\"); de.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\"; card.appendChild(de); de.layoutSizingHorizontal=\"FILL\"; }\n  const pr=FR(\"Price\",w,10,null,false); pr.layoutMode=\"HORIZONTAL\"; pr.layoutWrap=\"WRAP\"; pr.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\"; pr.counterAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; pr.itemSpacing=6; pr.counterAxisSpacing=2;\n  card.appendChild(pr); pr.layoutSizingHorizontal=\"FILL\";\n  const p1=T(d.price,13*s,\"Bold\",\"#1A1D1E\"); pr.appendChild(p1);\n  const p2=T(d.was,10*s,\"Medium\",\"#8F959E\"); p2.textDecoration=\"STRIKETHROUGH\"; pr.appendChild(p2);\n  const p3=T(d.off,10*s,\"SemiBold\",\"#F83758\"); pr.appendChild(p3);\n  if(d.count){\n    const rr=FR(\"Rating\",w,12,null,false); rr.layoutMode=\"HORIZONTAL\"; rr.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; rr.counterAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; rr.itemSpacing=4; rr.counterAxisAlignItems=\"CENTER\";\n    card.appendChild(rr);\n    const st=starC.createInstance(); rr.appendChild(st); st.resize(10*s,10*s);\n    const cnt=T(d.count,10*s,\"Medium\",\"#8F959E\"); rr.appendChild(cnt);\n  }\n  row.appendChild(card); card.x=x; card.y=0;\n  return card;\n}\n// deals: buildMini(dr,d,i*85,80/105); trending: buildMini(tr,d,i*67,64/105)\n```\n   - **Helper pattern (re-declare EVERY call)**:\n```js\nconst page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"5:2\");\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of [\"Regular\",\"Medium\",\"SemiBold\",\"Bold\"]) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Montserrat\",style:s});\nasync function M(id){return await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);}\nfunction hex(h){const n=parseInt(h.slice(1),16);return{r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255};}\nfunction solid(h,o){return{type:\"SOLID\",color:hex(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o};}\nfunction T(chars,size,style,color){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:\"Montserrat\",style};t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=[solid(color)];return t;}\nfunction FR(name,w,h,fill,clip){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.resize(w,h);f.fills=fill?[solid(fill)]:[];f.clipsContent=!!clip;return f;}\nfunction tint(node,color){const s=[solid(color)];for(const d of node.findAll(()=>true)){if(\"fills\" in d){try{d.fills=s;}catch(e){}}}if(\"fills\" in node){try{node.fills=s;}catch(e){}}}\n```\n   - **Verbatim fixed data (required word-for-word)**: Deal: Women Printed Kurta ₹1,500/₹2,499/40% Off/56,890; HRX by Hrithik Roshan ₹2,499/₹4,999/50% Off/3,44,567; Philips BHH880/10 + desc \"Hair Straightening Brush With Keratin Infused Bristles (Black).\" ₹999/₹1,999/50% Off/6,46,776; TITAN Men Watch- 1806N + desc \"This Titan watch in Black color is I wanted to buy for a long time\" ₹1,500/₹3,500/57% Off/15,007. Trending (lowercase \"off\", no rating counts): IWC Schaffhausen 2021 Pilot’s Watch “SIHH 2019” 44mm ₹650/₹1,599/59% off; Labbin White Sneakers For Men and Female ₹650/₹1,250/48% off; Mammon Women’s Handbag (Set of 3, Beige) ₹750/₹1,999/62% off; Do Bhai Women Wedges Sandal (Butterfly) ₹750/₹1,499/50% off; Lakme Enrich Matte Lipstick - Shade RM1 (4.7gm) ₹950/₹1,990/52% off. Product List 52,082+ Items: Black Winter Jacket/Autumn And Winter Casual cotton-padded jacket/₹499/6,890; Mens Starry/Mens Starry Sky Printed Shirt, 100% Cotton Fabric/₹399/1,52,344; Black Dress/Solid Black Dress for Women, Sexy Chain Shorts Ladies/₹2,000/5,23,456; Pink Embroidered Dress/EARTHEN Rose Pink Embroidered Tiered Maxi Dress/₹1,900/45,678; Flare Dress/Antheaa Black & Rust Orange Floral Print Tiered Midi Flared Dress/₹1,990/3,35,566; Denim Dress/Blue cotton denim dress, Look 2 printed cotton dress/₹999/27,344; Jordan Stay/The classic Air Jordan 12 to create a shoe that's fresh/₹4,999/10,23,456; Realme 7/6 GB RAM | 64 GB ROM | Expandable Upto 256 GB/₹3,499/3,44,567; Sony PS4/Sony PS4 Console, 1TB Slim with 3 Games/₹1,999/8,35,566; Black Jacket/Warm and comfortable everyday jacket/₹2,999/2,23,569; D7200 Digital Camera/D7200 Digital Camera (Nikon)/₹26,999/67,456 (no photo); Men's Formal Shoes/George Walker Derby Brown Formal Shoes/₹999/13,45,678; MuscleBlaze Muesli/Nutritional powerhouse: MuscleBlaze High Protein Muesli/₹3,900/1,35,566; Hot Chocolate/Hot chocolate with ashwagandha/₹200/6,23,569. Detail: Nike Sneakers / Vision Alta Men's Shoes Size (All Colours) / 56,890 ratings / ₹1,500 / ₹2,999 / 50% Off; paragraph \"Perhaps the most iconic sneaker of all-time, this original “Chicago” colorway is the cornerstone to any sneaker collection. Made famous in 1985 by Michael Jordan, the shoe has stood the test of time, becoming the most famous colorway of the Air Jordan 1. This 2015 release saw the…\" + More; sizes 6–10 UK (7 selected, \"Size: 7 UK\"); \"Delivery within 1 hour\"; Similar To 282+ Items: Nike Air Jordan Retro 1 Low Mystic Black ₹1,900/46,890; Mid Peach Mocha Shoes For Man White Black Pink Sneakers ₹1,900/2,56,890; Nike Air Jordan 1 Low Shoes For Man Basketball Shoes ₹1,900/1,56,890; Jordan 1 Hyper Royal Heavy Quality ₹1,500/96,890. Bag: Women's Casual Wear, Size 42, Qty 1, Delivery by 10 May, ₹7,000.00; Order Amounts ₹7,000.00 + Delivery Fee ₹30.00 = Order Total ₹7,030.00; payment Order ₹7,000/Shipping ₹30/Total ₹7,030; VISA/PayPal/Maestro/Apple Pay each \"*********2109\", VISA selected. Profile: aashifa@gmail.com, Password masked; N1 2LL / 216 St Paul's Rd / London / England / United Kingdom; 204356XXXXXXX / Abhiraj Sisodiya / SBIN00428; user Aashifa\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Nested instance override error (this segment)**: \"in set_x: This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform\" — caused by `lbl.x=...` on the \"View all\" text nested inside a Section Header instance (also would affect nm.resize/pr.resize inside mini instances). Call fully rolled back. Fix: replaced nested position/size manipulation with either direct texts (Sponsored header) or custom auto-layout frames (minis).\n   - **Missing row.appendChild(card) in buildMini**: second build attempt returned trendCards:0 — 9 mini cards orphaned at page origin (0,0 area). Fixed by a follow-up call: page.children filtered by name \"Mini · {short}\", reparented into Deal Row (x=i*85) / Trending Row (x=i*67). Result dCount:4, tCount:5, leftover:[].\n   - **Stale text height causing overlaps**: minis built with manual y math read nm.height as 1-line (16px) before reflow, so the price row rendered on top of the name's second line (visible in screenshot as \"₹1,50₹2,499\" collisions). Fixed by rebuilding minis as auto-layout VERTICAL stacks (no manual y math) — verified correct in re-screenshot.\n   - (Prior session, still relevant): reactions schema errors (AFTER_DELAY→AFTER_TIMEOUT, delay→timeout, action→actions, transition required); 11 bottom-bar overlap fixed by resizing to 375×1680; combineAsVariants page mismatch → setCurrentPageAsync first; appendChild inside instance not allowed → grayOut on fi