{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"14 完美：返回箭头正常（左上角 chevron ✓），支付成功弹窗（绿色圆 + 白色对勾 + \"Payment done successfully.\"）、45% 变暗覆盖层、导航 Cart 高亮。\n\n全部 15 屏已验证通过。现在检查原型连线是否完好（替换图标时用的是 insertChild + remove，不影响 reactions；但 14 是 13 的克隆，原型连线在之前的会话里已全部布好）。让我快速做一次只读检查确认所有帧的 reactions 数量，作为最终核对。\n\n之前已布好的原型（从摘要）：\n- 01 splash: 2s auto-advance → 02；click → 02\n- 02→03→04→05 链，含 Skip/Prev\n- 05 auth links → 06/07；06→05?；07\n- 08 Get Started → 09\n- 09: nav tab hotspots（Home/Wishlist/Cart/Search/Setting → 对应屏？）、Trending View all → 10、Sponsored banner → 11、Go to cart → 12（其实 11 上）\n- 11: Go to cart → 12\n- 12: Proceed to Payment → 13\n- 13: Continue → 14\n- 14: dialog → 09\n- 15: back → 09\n\n摘要说 \"full prototype wired\"。做一次快速只读验证：列出每帧的 reactions 总数，确认非零且关键帧有连线。\n\n代码：\n```js\nconst page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"5:2\");\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst ids = [\"13:39\",\"13:59\",\"13:85\",\"13:113\",\"14:108\",\"14:151\",\"14:200\",\"14:222\",\"17:345\",\"18:345\",\"19:527\",\"20:619\",\"21:637\",\"21:707\",\"21:731\"];\nconst out = [];\nfor (const id of ids) {\n  const f = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);\n  let count = 0;\n  const walk = (n) => { if (n.reactions && n.reactions.length) count += n.reactions.length; if (\"children\" in n) n.children.forEach(walk); };\n  walk(f);\n  out.push({frame: f.name, id, reactions: count});\n}\nreturn JSON.stringify(out);\n```\n注意 walk 会进入 instance children 吗？\"children\" in n 对 instance 为 true，会遍历 instance 内部——无妨，只统计。但 findAll 不深入 instance；手动 walk 会深入 instance 内部节点（可读）。没关系。\n\n跑这个验证，然后写最终答案。","signature":"bc535dae5ec44e268243c0c5"}],"id":"48f7e1a3-102f-4472-9bd8-80907de099e8","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"27c02197-3252-480f-900a-884ff728e974","uuid":"fc33d494-9895-4b89-871e-e2eec3b02eeb","timestamp":"2026-10-30T21:23:05.257Z","thinking_duration_ms":12499}
